      "age": 41.0,
      "feminine": 1.0,
      "hair": "brown_under_a_flour_cloth",
      "notes": "two covered baskets on a yoke, flour to the elbows, a Greyfold spoon hung round her neck on a thong, pilgrim grey only on Tolldays"
