    "bio": "Pulls the hand-cart up the ridge road from Tamwick to Grandfather Hollow three days a week: cider, candles, rope, whatever the Hollow asked for last time, and back with what the Wold will part with. It is a long day's road through the Lower Wold and she does it alone, which the Woodfolk think is brave and she thinks is quicker.",
    "unique_habit": "Stops at the Weighing Stone every trip to weigh her own cart on the carters' beam, though nobody has asked her to since the Tallymen stopped caring.",
