    "home_place": "core:place/rookdown",
    "no_radiant": true,
    "dialogue": "core:dialogue/maddoc_dray",
    "bio": "Drives Rookdown's sheep over the Brow to Bramcombe's sheep-wash in the morning and drinks at the Hare and Hurdle at noon, and has done both every day of his working life. He is the one who noticed the rooks would not fly south of the green, and he has said so to nobody but his dogs.",
    "unique_habit": "Counts his sheep through every gate with the old Bramcombe numbers, yan tan tethera, and swears they come out one more than went in on the way back.",
    "personality": {
